<title>SRI LANKA: Sri Lanka T-bill yields continue down.</title>
<headline>Sri Lanka T-bill yields continue down.</headline>
<dateline>COLOMBO 1997-04-02</dateline>
<text>
<p>The average yields of three, six and 12-month treasury bills fell by 1.10, 0.97 and 0.56 percentage points respectively at Wednesday's auction, the Central Bank said.</p>
<p>		   Bids received   Bids accepted   Avg yield</p>
<p>    3 months     2,301	     1,960	  10.81 (11.91)</p>
<p>    6 months     2,602	     1,217	  12.09 (13.06)</p>
<p>    12 months    1,257		 440	  12.92 (13.48)</p>
<p>    Total	  6,160	     3,617</p>
<p>NOTE - Bids in million rupees, yields in percent (previous week's yields in brackets). --Colombo newsroom (941) 434319</p>
</text>
